NOTE ON BUNDLED COMPONENTS

This license covers GobboNet itself: the launcher, the PowerShell services
and the web front end. It does not cover things GobboNet downloads for you
at runtime, which carry their own terms:

  llama.cpp  - MIT, from the ggml-org/llama.cpp releases
  models     - each GGUF has its own licence set by whoever trained it.
               Some are permissive, some restrict commercial use, some
               require you to accept terms on Hugging Face first. Check
               the model card before you rely on one for anything that
               matters.
